| Period | Trades | W/L | Win Rate | Net R | Profit Factor | Expectancy |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Week 1 | 9 | 8 / 1 | 88.9% | +15R | 16.00 | +1.67R |
| Week 2 | 11 | 3 / 8 | 27.3% | -2R | 0.75 | -0.18R |
| **Cumulative** | **20** | **11 / 9** | **55.0%** | **+13R** | **2.44** | **+0.65R** |

**Status:** CONTINUE

The contrast between Week 1 and Week 2 demonstrates why short-term win rate is not used as the primary measure of strategy quality.

