## Important

These are small forward-test samples and should not be interpreted as estimates of future returns.

Strategies remain frozen during forward testing to reduce the risk of adapting parameters to recently observed outcomes.

Full methodology and historical context are documented in the latest **The Forge Systematic Trading Research Chronicle**.
